						<h2>Football Widgets</h2>
                        <p style="text-align:left; margin-top:-30px">
						<br/>Here at apifootball.com we're working hard every day to satisfy your deepest needs.
								And because we care about your time and money spent on building your applications. We are very happy to bring you great news!
								We've proudly launched an complete set of football API widgets for any kind of sports sites.
								Enough with money lost on developing from scratch. Enough with tons of hours of hard coding.
								Stop wasting your time and use one box to box solution for your site!
								It's easy to integrate as "copy paste", fully customisable (pure HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and it's free on every plan you'll choose.
								You can have your own fully featured football livescore site in minutes without knowing any programming language.
								Get your <a href="https://apifootball.com/widgets-documentation/">widgets</a> now and let your dreams come true!
                        </p>

